<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia 1996 GDP up preliminary 3.1 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia 1996 GDP up preliminary 3.1 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator detail on Tuesday.</p>
<p>GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT (first estimate, not seasonally adjusted)</p>
<p>						   1996     1995</p>
<p> year-on-year increase (pct)		3.1	3.9</p>
<p> total (billions of tolars)	   1,181.2  1,146.0</p>
<p>QUARTERLY BREAKDOWN:</p>
<p>					 Q4 96   Q3 96  Q2 96  Q1 96</p>
<p> change on previous quarter    +4.4    +0.5   +3.9    -4.5</p>
<p> change on year-ago quarter    +4.1    +3.4   +2.5    +2.2</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439 ($ = 157.3 Slovenian Tolars</p>
</text>
